  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/znHQQtuU/images/653b6f24f05341edcd3cba3164edd0b8d2c0dd71.png\" alt=\"更多佳肴\" width=\"408\" height=\"111\"></p><p><strong>踏上更丰富的烹饪之旅</strong>——More Delight 是农夫乐事的一个模组，增加了更多菜肴、刀具和食材。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-forge/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/to1Ri2x.png\" alt=\"下载更新\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXy6vrX.png\" alt=\"Fabric 下载\" width=\"174\" height=\"36\"></a></p><h2>🍽️ 功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>用新的菜肴和食材扩展你的菜单。</li>\n<li>使用面包片轻松制作三明治。</li>\n<li>享用由面包片制成的脆皮吐司。</li>\n<li>装备木刀和石刀，体验烹饪的精准。</li>\n</ul><h2>🛠️ 兼容模组</h2><ul>\n<li>Expanded Delight</li>\n<li>Casualness Delight</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>机械动力 (Create)</li>\n<li>Some Assembly Required</li>\n</ul><p>这些菜肴的灵感多来自我女友烹饪的美味佳肴。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"攒钱买笔记本中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按钮\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐赠按钮\"></a></p>",
